## Why This Is Asked

Assesses ability to design a production-ready online continual learning system under delayed feedback, latency, memory limits, and non-stationary user behavior, with fairness concerns.

## Key Concepts

- Online continual learning with delayed labels
- Factorization machines and warm-start online SGD
- Calibration, drift detection, and memory-budget governance

## Code Example

```javascript
// Skeleton online update loop for streaming features
function onlineUpdate(x, y, w, lr) {
  const pred = 1 / (1 + Math.exp(-dot(w, x)));
  const g = pred - y;
  for (let i = 0; i < x.length; i++) w[i] -= lr * g * x[i];
  return w;
}
```

